{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "e6620714c7bea8f33fdc56e0695984fd25337959dc09a1e68f296ee528e89e9e", "ja": "いったい、どうして？", "zh": "到底为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3d0d9d981a208ae8be1e2df846e91dcbc49df5cb5ab9540d5d956761b54af839", "ja": "宣伝のためバラエティ番組に出演する六幕\nメンバー。トークで自身が演じるクロエと\n同じようなウケ方をした紬は、その日から\n少し元気がない。のり子はプロデューサーに\n自分に任せてと言い、紬をタンデムに誘う。", "zh": "为了做宣传，第六幕的成员们出演了\n一档综艺节目。紬在谈话环节逗乐大家的\n反应，和自己饰演的克洛伊如出一辙，自那\n天起便有些闷闷不乐。法子对制作人表示\n交给自己就好，随后邀请紬一起乘摩托车兜风。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e36b28475ca961f894337bec46d1e15f0c56f240c9e52812aa171ba4df03148e", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』第六幕が始動！　芝居の\n稽古はもちろん、宣伝活動にも力を入れないとな）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》第六幕正式开始！排练自不必说，宣传活动也得加把劲才行）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "98be1bb78a4eed2410aaa494904de67106ef2f948528b03343b55f61c5c1c52f", "ja": "（今日は、音楽バラエティ番組にゲスト出演。\n新曲と一緒にトークでのアピール、頼んだぞ！）", "zh": "（今天要作为嘉宾参加音乐综艺节目。拜托你配合新歌，在谈话环节好好宣传一番！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1002_mc", "source_sha256": "fdcc3cb283b8f4b71b407e21fcd6a5d47916ab6dcf774a7a74968369246b1f0c", "ja": "765プロライブ劇場で開催中の\n『STARDOM ROAD』、各所で話題ですよね～！", "zh": "在765艺能演唱会剧场举办中的\n“STARDOM ROAD”，在各处都成了热门话题呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1003_mc", "source_sha256": "03562eca05505d53aebd5fa77c53450b49f1716812a7513d51b45e4295b38316", "ja": "みなさんは第六幕の舞台に立たれるとの事で、\n自己紹介と意気込みをお願いします！", "zh": "听说各位将登上第六幕的舞台，\n请大家做个自我介绍，并说说自己的抱负吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9023c463e4b69c59675cd10036f50858ee71c3db794b85edc4898380ace5b9ab", "ja": "はい、白石紬と申します。\n第六幕で、暁クロエ役を担当いたします。", "zh": "是的，我叫白石䌷。\n在第六幕中，我将饰演晓克洛伊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "001ec8ceae293964b8ad201701757c85256b3f72cc2d04c142d3da8171a1b837", "ja": "僭越ながら第六幕の主演ということで……\n全身全霊で、臨む所存です！", "zh": "承蒙厚爱，能够担任第六幕的主演……\n我会倾尽全力迎接挑战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "d6c6675f30a5501cc210ee028b556d0d313cef50adc0765a9fefdba25c778a8e", "ja": "笹森藍役、福田のり子です！　お芝居の稽古も、\nもう始まったんですけど……。", "zh": "我是饰演笹森蓝的福田法子！排练也已经开始了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "285d0bc229c04cd9c54cb282a8fae3a9305368181afa0d8fef984f53db8ad211", "ja": "みんな、紬に負けないくらい気合い入ってます！\n毎日猛特訓して、本番まで駆け抜けるよ！", "zh": "大家可都不输给紬，干劲十足呢！\n每天都要好好特训，一口气冲到正式演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ebe792bdd3c5ec0fef7ff17e643eb55976bb580e9cdc77428c5dec324a1a96e0", "ja": "毎日猛特訓……するかは、わからないですけど～。\nでも、今回のお仕事は、けっこう面白いかも？", "zh": "虽然不知道会不会每天进行魔鬼特训～  \n不过，这次的工作说不定还挺有意思的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "acf8b2c6af14b7eabc09bc58347d40707824051e9c7b1e7a6107cfc07493d7e5", "ja": "わたしの演じる一宮真珠星を、たくさんの人に\n見てもらえたらいいな。よろしくお願いしまーす♪", "zh": "要是我演的一宫真珠星，能让很多很多人\n看到就好了呢。还请多多指教啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "a3d4310405542a76b36c19670dfd009b8fffb7a9111d19c08d8359a2954a3f56", "ja": "三船なる役の、木下ひなたです。今回のお芝居は、\n劇場のみんなで繋いできたお話なんだわ。", "zh": "我是饰演三船なる的木下日向。这次的剧，是剧场大家共同延续下来的故事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "906b5a26d6124891be128ec30a8798766144031aad975bcb035f38721570fbe3", "ja": "みんなに喜んでもらえるように、がんばらねば。\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "为了让大家都能开心，我得加油才行。\n请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1012_mc", "source_sha256": "ead0bbba83adb32a1d8f2ca435ec722acd47093b812240cb1043168c72cc53f3", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nみなさんの気迫が感じられましたね！", "zh": "非常感谢！\n能感受到大家的气魄呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1013_mc", "source_sha256": "36fc37c0993f1ef280db0f841f200a5479920c78aa26ce66662cb00c25f5441f", "ja": "白石さんは、以前にも『EScape』で\nクールな役柄を演じられていましたが……。", "zh": "白石小姐之前也曾在《EScape》中饰演过冷酷的角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d7a2a05b8455b45fc6ef43e369c65e72340a57fa3f8d69ee0054890de8c6d696", "ja": "あ、はい。\nご存知でしたか。", "zh": "啊，是的。您知道这件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1015_mc", "source_sha256": "45f4f574862fa70b474680f0393b092bdb69d36b396fe368999673fe12c3b0f8", "ja": "暁クロエも、クールな魅力がありますし。\nやはり北国出身だからこその、クール抜擢ですか！？", "zh": "晓克洛伊也有一种冷酷的魅力呢。\n果然是因为来自北方，才被选中出演冷酷角色的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "05909f12f5060d2c59247d3cca4c715438c7630351dfc22d731f4969af3855ec", "ja": "えっ……。いえ、そのようなことは\n聞いていませんので、違うと思いますが……。", "zh": "咦……不是的，我没听说过这种事，所以应该不是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1017_mc", "source_sha256": "8f4985ad3a04b940bf872c3527e5e808c42296d17f3c4f8347380387ac4f91c4", "ja": "ですよねー！\n出身地で選ぶわけが……。", "zh": "就是嘛——！\n怎么可能按出生地来选……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fb87ad8a65b74f40950f9c608850cff69aee6b183f1f39127218a77e36be6be9", "ja": "はい。それに、もしそれが理由なら、\n北海道出身の木下さんが選ばれるはず。", "zh": "是的。而且，如果那就是理由的话，来自北海道的木下小姐应该会被选中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "166fbcbd249f0b49152f65f5cff45e33cc9f37c04717ea1e05f0997595ea2aaf", "ja": "ですから、出身地による選出ではありません。", "zh": "所以，并不是根据出生地来选人的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1021_audience", "source_sha256": "658ee7c10a9fee929a78a5ceeff3bff8c76445d739c82db03abbb0ec3a460529", "ja": "ワハハハハハッ！！！", "zh": "哇哈哈哈哈哈！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ec5bbd5ece5ad8c3f1c21f240affbe2a4efbf1a44b4602b560ad39bbbf3f013b", "ja": "？　え？　私、何かおかしなことを……？\nその、出身地で言えば、北海道が一番……。", "zh": "咦？啊？我做了什么奇怪的事吗……？那个，要说出生地的话，北海道是最……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1023_mc", "source_sha256": "f4a83427053d4198b272ce576117e1616d856675333c551dfd7ac70d82c61690", "ja": "いえ、確かにその通りですよね！\n大丈夫、白石さんの考え方が正しいです！", "zh": "不，确实就是这样呢！\n没关系，白石小姐的想法是正确的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "269f5576128455a1ac560fb62d39f0158d7682e190efec434d1d27457f372d23", "ja": "（こ、これは……）", "zh": "（这、这是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8f2d0ac16dcef384453b2e27a8fad2d163f0cac688e62ca8107904c0a147c0d5", "ja": "（この前の稽古でも似たような事が……\nクロエが真剣に答えたのに、笑いを取っていて……）", "zh": "（之前排练的时候也发生过类似的事……明明克洛伊是认真回答的，却逗得大家笑了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1026_043nor", "source_sha256": "e94d5780a1366eea1c498307f735f47ff2b61dcd249c2f0bf28805397be8c3b2", "ja": "紬、紬。\n……今の、この間のお芝居みたいだったね？", "zh": "紬，紬。\n……刚才那样，和前阵子演的那出戏很像吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "509a6d52a2fd476de29b75c3faa56976c4ec0e643d66601cfa56ccee077f485c", "ja": "は、はい……。\n本当に……。", "zh": "是、是的……  \n真的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a44c2116b3358703607d1fac38d32fd1fda23c7082c88d46ceec5addc46657e8", "ja": "クロエと、私……似たようなことを……。\n……。", "zh": "克洛伊和我……做了类似的事……。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1030_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "75351e1aa85215a4e8d13c459d39b62c16274005ee0cebf187129bec16fe10d7", "ja": "はあ……。", "zh": "这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b0424293f4efaaadd5d3cf99b1928b97f46896862794ee3852920255937fcbfe", "ja": "ねえねえ、ひなたちゃん。\n紬さん、なんかちょっぴり元気ないかも……？", "zh": "喂喂，小日向。\n紬好像有点没精神……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1033_035hin", "source_sha256": "89c54f418c6d525c69243db9de6acb72ad2c2bfcbe898c1b4b206359f7c6431b", "ja": "翼ちゃんも、そう思うかい？\nこの前、TVに出た時くらいからだよねぇ……。", "zh": "小翼也这么觉得吗？从上次上电视的时候开始，就这样了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "581033bc2d05c244a1d3c72fac6c5fc28fb8b9c07d1b0ae0d1b702405bb1858b", "ja": "でもあの時は、ちゃんと宣伝できたし、\n笑いも取れてたし……バッチリだったよね？", "zh": "不过那时候宣传也做得很到位，\n也成功逗大家笑了……挺完美的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1035_035hin", "source_sha256": "02b3955349400de65a04aa82265f2f2586f7709f9b4343aa39c97a3236fd87ea", "ja": "そうだねぇ。あたしにも話を振ってくれて、\nありがたかったって、紬さんにも話したよぉ。", "zh": "是啊。你还把话题抛给了我，我也跟紬小姐说了，真的很感谢你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1036_p", "source_sha256": "8d721002376bdb0f8769e9023de9edb089e96d7fd6ca900bd164603e7e118d91", "ja": "理由は、もう少し深いところにあるのかもしれないな。\n紬に、話を聞いてみるか……。", "zh": "理由或许还在更深层的地方吧。要不要去问问紬……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1037_043nor", "source_sha256": "e646c0bfa60134943ef3f1325ce8a7a78bc99ec8dffa8c4ec267c0019a20445c", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}。\nそれ、アタシに任せてもらってもいい？", "zh": "呐呐，{$P$}。\n那个可以交给我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1038_p", "source_sha256": "386a06349239189ca4b21813cbebd2410bab737def15a94979c49744d859163c", "ja": "のり子に？\nなにか策があるってことか？", "zh": "交给纪子？\n你是说你有办法了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1039_043nor", "source_sha256": "0e382b0fbb882fdbdc029f168bb443e02645c2ffa7aac10820bf988af8474201", "ja": "へへ、策ってほどじゃないけど……\n気晴らしなら、いい考えがあるんだ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，算不上什么对策啦……\n不过要是想转换一下心情，我倒是有个好主意♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1040_043nor", "source_sha256": "f93bc815dfae344027a1ebdb942c49bb9cabb90bbbaabd84900fda4e3a1e1021", "ja": "これでもアタシ、六幕では最年長だしね！\nねっ、いいでしょ？", "zh": "别看我这样，在第六幕里我可是年纪最大的呢！\n对吧，这主意不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1041_p", "source_sha256": "fdf9694ffabb5be52bf5272ce0189668aa955ac27ae54ff80d7ccfec9f37e9a7", "ja": "……ああ、そうだな。\nそういうことなら、のり子に任せた！", "zh": "……啊啊，说得也是。\n既然这样，那就交给你了，法子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1042_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1043_043nor", "source_sha256": "7dbf1b99755c52bb0c7cace2548cf459ed8529a9ba1f2f7b92e94ec9b92f794c", "ja": "ねえ、紬！\n今日ってこの後予定ある？", "zh": "喂，紬！\n你今天接下来有安排吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1044_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ebfae14ab393fd003fa2f642bfb5b0f2774e92cd09537c2715abf08b86eadbf8", "ja": "？\nいいえ、特にありませんが……。", "zh": "？没有，暂时没什么安排……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_02_1045_043nor", "source_sha256": "2e3934db5fa5059737d0c801ff911c046c2a790e0cda30c71a8d80aca75a54aa", "ja": "それなら、ちょっと付き合ってよ。\nアタシとタンデム♪", "zh": "那就陪我一会儿吧。\n和我一起骑双人摩托♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
